flowchart LR
    APP[App pods] --> PB[PgBouncer / RDS Proxy]
    PB --> EP[Writer endpoint - DNS/VIP]
    EP --> P[(Primary)]
    P -->|replication| R1[(Replica 1)]
    P --> R2[(Replica 2)]
    HB[Failover manager - Patroni] -->|promote + repoint| EP
    APP -.->|reads| RE[Reader endpoint] --> R1 & R2
    P -.->|fencing blocks writes| X[Demoted node]
